window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Two empires. One war. And a boy caught in the middle.</b></p> <p>Locked in a brutal conflict, the Paladin Kingdom and the Ascendant Empire wage a battle for dominance that’s left the world scarred. But far from the frontlines, a different kind of resistance brews in secret.</p> <p>When Locke Maxwell discovers a power buried within him and the truth about his mother’s past, he’s drawn into the hidden war waged by the <b>Knights of Fate</b>, an outlawed order founded to defy both sides. Trained in ancient magic and forbidden truths, Locke must choose where he stands in a world where trust is scarce, power is deadly, and fate can be rewritten.</p> <p><b>Perfect for fans of epic magic systems, rebellious heroes, and high-stakes battles,</b> <i>Deck of Fates</i> is a gripping fantasy debut where loyalty is tested, destinies collide, and the line between hero and weapon begins to blur.</p>"; 
